\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces A small treatment process and its model. Components become nodes, dependencies become directed edges, and the duplicated treatment stage becomes a pair of parallel routes that later reconverge.}}{19}{figure.caption.10}%
